{"id":"n62239-2-8","stage":1,"title":"아프다 · 疼","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62239-2-8-1","ko":"엉덩이가 아파서 더 이상 못 앉아 있겠다.","zh":"我的屁股好痛，实在坐不下去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엉덩이가","meaning":"屁股，臀部","explanation":"엉덩이：屁股，臀部；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"엉덩이","audio":"/audio/25d6d1ae86b669fab14a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15128","senseId":"1","lemma":"엉덩이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엉덩이가","audio":"/audio/0fe26398dbde804e7710.mp3"}},{"text":"아파서","meaning":"疼，痛","explanation":"아프다：疼，痛；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"2","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파서","audio":"/audio/1d188c109f3d5cabce14.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"이상","meaning":"以上","explanation":"이상：以上。","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"1","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"앉아","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉아","audio":"/audio/709a1afa79c56d9a698a.mp3"}},{"text":"있겠다.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있겠다","audio":"/audio/6e792c6008a1cd1801aa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"25d6d1ae86b669fa","term":"엉덩이","zh":"屁股，臀部","audio":"/audio/25d6d1ae86b669fab14a.mp3","entryId":"15128","definition":"指连接腰部与大腿的盆骨部分后方的浑圆部位。当坐下来时，其部位接触地面。","pronunciation":["엉ː덩이"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼，痛","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"身体的某些部位使用过多而感到疲劳或难受。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"以上","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"数量或程度好于或高于一定基准。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/55837aee169cbc835991.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62239-2-8-2","ko":"그럼 우리 잠깐 산책이라도 하고 올까?","zh":"那我们出去散散步再回来吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"source