0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57312","definition":"非常短的时间。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"b745d43721954853","term":"산책","zh":"散步","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3","entryId":"62506","definition":"为了稍作休息或身体健康而在附近慢慢地走路。","pronunciation":["산ː책"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（산책을 하다：散步）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（산책을 하다：散步）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7f39b1a1275d20ac816d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62239","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":33,"sequenceScore":1.5042,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我的屁股好痛，实在坐不下去了。","那我们出去散散步再回来吧？","感觉地面在震动呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我的屁股好痛，实在坐不下去了。","那我们出去散散步再回来吧？","感觉地面在震动呢。"],"answer":1}]}
